(load "carp-collections.carp")

(Project.config "title" "carp-collections")
(Project.config "docs-directory" "./docs/")
(Project.config "docs-logo" "")
(Project.config "docs-url" "https://github.com/carpentry-org/carp-collections")
(Project.config "docs-styling" "../style.css")
(Project.config "docs-prelude" "Ten container types for Carp, in one package.

Load the whole suite, or any single module on its own:
```
(load \"git@github.com:carpentry-org/carp-collections@master\")
; or, for just one:
(load \"git@github.com:carpentry-org/carp-collections@master\" \"deque.carp\")
```

### Sequences
- [`Deque`](./Deque.html) — double-ended queue over a growable ring buffer, amortized `O(1)` at both ends
- [`RingBuf`](./RingBuf.html) — fixed-capacity circular buffer
- [`Stack`](./Stack.html) — LIFO stack over an array

### Sets and maps
- [`HashSet`](./HashSet.html) — set built on `Map`, with union, intersection and difference
- [`BitSet`](./BitSet.html) — dynamic bitset over `Uint64` words
- [`BitFlags`](./BitFlags.html) — type-safe integer bitmask, plus the `bitflags` macro
- [`SparseSet`](./SparseSet.html) — integer ids to values, `O(1)` and contiguous for iteration

### Pools and handles
- [`Handle`](./Handle.html) — generational handle into a pool
- [`StablePool`](./StablePool.html) — generational object pool, `O(1)` alloc and free, handles stay valid
- [`Slot`](./Slot.html) — a single `StablePool` cell

### Priority
- [`PriorityQueue`](./PriorityQueue.html) — binary-heap priority queue")

(save-docs BitFlags
           BitSet
           Deque
           Handle
           HashSet
           PriorityQueue
           RingBuf
           Slot
           SparseSet
           StablePool
           Stack)
; Carp's save-docs hardcodes the index filename as <title>_index.html.
; Rename to docs/index.html.
(defn main []
  (System.system "mv ./docs/carp-collections_index.html ./docs/index.html"))
